1.12 Expected Outcomes
The project was expected to achieve:
•	Increased poultry meat production.
•	Improved income generation.
•	Better disease management.
•	Reduced feed wastage.
•	Improved water use efficiency.
•	Enhanced entrepreneurship skills.
•	Promotion of climate-smart agriculture.
•	Improved record-keeping skills.
•	Increased student participation in practical agriculture.
